  "details": "VRChat's UI cursor/ray laser will become stuck when pointing at a UI shape with no rectTransform attached.\n\nOn Quest specifically causes a lot of lag from the errors (despite logging being off).\n\n1. Create a cube with a box collider.\n\n2. Add the VRC UI Shape component.\n\n3. Add a World space UI Canvas behind the cube.\n\n4. Test in Client (publish or Build & Test).\n\n5. Attempt to point at the UI canvas first, then point at the cube. The laser or cursor will get stuck until you stop pointing at the cube.",
